# MADP HDX Palette v1.0
#
# ChimeraX does not require named-color registration for normal use.
# Use these exact hexadecimal colors in generated .cxc files:
#
# hdx_blue3    #3366E6   strong protection
# hdx_blue2    #6699FF   moderate protection
# hdx_blue1    #A6BFFF   weak protection
# hdx_gray0    #595959   neutral
# hdx_red1     #FFB3B3   weak deprotection
# hdx_red2     #F27373   moderate deprotection
# hdx_red3     #D93333   strong deprotection
# hdx_unmapped #A8A8A8   no coverage
#
# Example:
# color /A:100-110 #3366E6 target c
# color protein #A8A8A8 target c
